  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1201.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to implement the program established by RSA 485-A:45-54.\n\nSource. #1908, eff 1-6-82; ss by #2707, eff 5-15-84, EXPIRED: 5-15-90\n\nNew. #4845, eff 6-20-90, EXPIRED: 6-20-96\n\nNew. #6304, eff 7-26-96; ss by #8124, INTERIM, eff 7-26-04, EXPIRES: 1-22-05; ss by #8235, eff 12-22-04 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1200) (formerly Env-Ws 1201.01); ss by #9798-A, eff 10-9-10; ss by #12739, eff 3-19-19",
